<title>USA: Meredith Corp Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Meredith Corp Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		 $   0.61		   $ 0.57</p>
<p> Oper net		   17,076		   16,078</p>
<p> Revs			209,772		  216,108</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   27,875		   28,291</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 net excludes gain from discontinued operations of $27.7 million or $1.00 a share.</p>
<p>Six Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $ 1.06		   $ 0.91</p>
<p> Oper net		   29,537		   25,587</p>
<p> Revs			408,952		  422,681</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   27,817		   28,189</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 six months net excludes gain from discontinued operations of $27.7 million or $1.00 a share.</p>
<p>1995 six months net excludes loss from discontinued operations of $717,000 or $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
